#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/settings.rs:101
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/booster_button.rs:57
msgid "Turbo Mode"
msgstr "Режим Turbo"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/booster_button.rs:59
